{"seq":4,"slug":"incident-response","title":"安全事件响应","stage":"DONE","category":"cybersecurity-applied","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response","rating":{"composite":3.83,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.43,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 安全事件响应\n\n安全事件响应（Incident Response，IR）是网络安全防御体系中最关键的实战能力之一。当安全事件发生时，组织需要快速、有序地执行一系列标准化流程，从检测、分析、遏制到恢复，最大程度降低事件造成的业务影响和数据损失。\n\n本 Hub 系统介绍安全事件响应的完整知识体系，涵盖从基础框架到高级自动化的全链路内容。第一章建立事件响应的理论基础，包括 NIST SP 800-61、SANS PICERL 等主流框架的生命周期模型，响应团队的组建与能力矩阵，以及事件分类分级的标准化方法。第二章深入检测与分析技术，涵盖 SIEM 日志分析、网络流量取证和终端内存取证三大核心领域。第三章聚焦遏制与根除阶段，讲解隔离策略、恶意软件逆向分析方法和系统恢复流程。第四章关注事后处置，包括复盘改进机制、数字证据的司法保全，以及基于 SOAR 平台的响应自动化实践。\n\n内容以 2025—2026 年行业最新实践为基准，结合 MITRE ATT&CK 框架、NIST 网络安全框架（CSF 2.0）等权威标准，面向安全运营工程师、应急响应团队成员及安全管理者。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ir-fundamentals","title":"事件响应基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/ir-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ir-lifecycle","title":"事件响应生命周期与框架","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/ir-fundamentals/ir-lifecycle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ir-team-building","title":"安全响应团队建设与能力矩阵","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/ir-fundamentals/ir-team-building"},{"seq":3,"slug":"incident-classification","title":"安全事件分类与分级体系","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/ir-fundamentals/incident-classification"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"detection-analysis","title":"检测与分析","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/detection-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"siem-log-analysis","title":"SIEM 与日志分析方法","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/detection-analysis/siem-log-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-forensics","title":"网络取证与流量分析","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/detection-analysis/network-forensics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"endpoint-forensics","title":"终端取证与内存分析","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/detection-analysis/endpoint-forensics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"containment-eradication","title":"遏制与根除","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/containment-eradication","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"containment-strategies","title":"遏制策略与隔离技术","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/containment-eradication/containment-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"malware-analysis","title":"恶意软件分析方法","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/containment-eradication/malware-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"recovery-restoration","title":"系统恢复与业务复原","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/containment-eradication/recovery-restoration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"post-incident","title":"事后处置","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/post-incident","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"post-incident-review","title":"事后复盘与改进机制","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/post-incident/post-incident-review"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digital-evidence","title":"数字证据保全与司法协作","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/post-incident/digital-evidence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ir-automation","title":"事件响应自动化与 SOAR","url":"/h/cybersecurity-applied/incident-response/post-incident/ir-automation"}]}]}